     "w": 2500,
     "h": 1650
    },
    {
     "type": "h2",
     "text": "Traffic Reform Warriors"
    },
    {
     "type": "p",
     "html": "Traffic safety shouldn’t be an afterthought—it should be a priority."
    },
    {
     "type": "p",
     "html": "The <a href=\"https://www.trafficreformwarriors.org/\" target=\"_blank\">Traffic Reform Warriors</a> are a coalition of Jersey City residents fighting for safer streets, better enforcement<strong>,</strong> and real accountability from city officials."
    },
    {
     "type": "p",
     "html": "We are parents, commuters, cyclists, and pedestrians who believe that no one should fear for their life just crossing the street."
    }
   ],
